OL,4,BLehmann again denies knowing about     
OL,5,Bsandpaper plot                         
OL,6,GFormer Australia coach Darren Lehmann  
OL,7,Ghas again vehemently denied any        
OL,8,Gknowledge of the sandpaper plot,       
OL,9,Gdespite detailed allegations from      
OL,10,GCameron Bancroft.                      
OL,12,FIn an ongoing row about the cheating   
OL,13,Fscandal that took place in Australia's 
OL,14,Fthird Test against South Africa in     
OL,15,F2018, Bancroft published a testimony   
OL,16,Frunning to more than 4,000 words in    
OL,17,Fthe West Australian newspaper on       
OL,18,FWednesday.                             
